# Keep Docker build context small & reproducible
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.pytest_cache
.git
.github
test-results
.claude
design
infra
*.log

# macOS AppleDouble resource forks. `tar` on macOS emits a `._<name>` companion
# for every file carrying xattrs; `._foo.py` ends in .py, so tools that glob for
# source (alembic's migration loader, for one) try to parse it and choke on its
# binary contents.
._*
.DS_Store
